# Law: lawtwin.kafka::Broker: offsets in a partition are dense and
# increasing [cluster]
# Description: Two batches produced one after the other to one partition
# get offsets
# that follow on: the second starts where the first ends.
# Rationale:
# References:
# Expansion:
# Broker: offsets in a partition are dense and increasing [cluster]
# for all (t :: Text) (first :: List
# (lawtwin.kafka.model::type::Record)) (second :: List
