# Law: lawtwin.kafka::Broker: a member of an older generation cannot
# commit [cluster]
# Description: A new member starts a new generation. A member still at
# the old one is
# told to rejoin, and its commits are refused, so it cannot overwrite
# the
# offsets of the partitions it may have lost.
