# Law: lawtwin.kafka::GroupCoordinator: a heartbeat from an older
# generation asks the member to rejoin [cluster]
# Description: A rebalance moves the group to a new generation. A member
# at the old
# one is told so on its next heartbeat; when it rejoins with the same
# subscription it learns the new generation without starting another.
# Rationale:
# References:
# Expansion:
# GroupCoordinator: a heartbeat from an older generation asks the member
# to rejoin [cluster]
# for all (t :: Text) (g :: Text) (one :: Text) (other :: Text) .
# created (_input0) (1) implies match (attempt (joinGroup (_input1)
# (_input2) (List::Cons(_input0, List::Nil())))) { Either::Left
# _match0__0__e -> false; Either::Right _match0__1__old -> let
# _let1__new = attempt (joinGroup (_input1) (_input3)
